{
  "id": "example.mountain-main",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "exports": [
    "journey"
  ],
  "content": {
    "station": {
      "title": "旧驿站",
      "paragraphs": [
        "暮色将山谷染成淡淡的灰紫，旧驿站的木牌在风中轻轻晃动，字迹斑驳，几乎看不清原来的名号。这里曾是往来行旅歇脚换马的所在，现在只剩一间低矮的木屋，屋顶上落满了枯叶。",
        "你推开吱呀作响的木门，屋内空荡，只有一张破旧的桌子。登记册的最后一页写着：往山口去的人，请先到营地找守火老人。他还留着一封信。",
        "夜色渐深，冷风从门缝里钻进来。前方的山路看不清尽头，而不远处似乎有一处营地的火光在摇曳。你需要决定接下来的行动。"
      ]
    },
    "gate": {
      "title": "抵达山口",
      "paragraphs": [
        "石门从雾里显出轮廓。守门人提着灯走下台阶，先看了看你身后的路，才伸出手。",
        "“驿站那边，有消息吗？”他问。"
      ]
    }
  },
  "graphs": {
    "journey": {
      "title": "主线",
      "entry": "station",
      "outcomes": [
        "arrived",
        "delivered"
      ],
      "shared": {
        "rations": "int",
        "letter": "bool",
        "rests": "int",
        "helped": "bool"
      },
      "imports": {
        "road": {
          "parameters": {},
          "outcomes": [
            "crossed",
            "retreated"
          ]
        },
        "camp": {
          "parameters": {
            "visitor": "text"
          },
          "outcomes": [
            "left",
            "rested"
          ]
        }
      },
      "nodes": {
        "station": {
          "type_id": "narrata.decision",
          "data": {
            "content": "station",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "road",
                "label": "沿山路出发",
                "target": "road"
              },
              {
                "id": "camp",
                "label": "到营地歇脚",
                "target": "camp"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "road": {
          "type_id": "narrata.call",
          "data": {
            "target": {
              "kind": "import",
              "port": "road"
            },
            "arguments": {},
            "on_return": {
              "crossed": "gate",
              "retreated": "station"
            }
          }
        },
        "camp": {
          "type_id": "narrata.call",
          "data": {
            "target": {
              "kind": "import",
              "port": "camp"
            },
            "arguments": {
              "visitor": {
                "kind": "literal",
                "value": "你"
              }
            },
            "on_return": {
              "left": "station",
              "rested": "station"
            }
          }
        },
        "gate": {
          "type_id": "narrata.decision",
          "data": {
            "content": "gate",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "deliver",
                "label": "将老人的信交给守门人",
                "enabled_if": {
                  "kind": "read",
                  "scope": "shared",
                  "name": "letter"
                },
                "disabled_reason": "需要先从营地老人那里取到信件",
                "target": "delivered"
              },
              {
                "id": "arrive",
                "label": "告诉他沿途的见闻，结束旅程",
                "target": "arrived"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "delivered": {
          "type_id": "narrata.return",
          "data": {
            "outcome": "delivered"
          }
        },
        "arrived": {
          "type_id": "narrata.return",
          "data": {
            "outcome": "arrived"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
